  "description": "A chilling and sensual possession romance brought on by an endless obsession with one woman. In 1940, during a time of chaos, a beautiful mansion called Yeongchunhwa is built on a secluded island, constructed purely out of a man's deep love for his wife. Over time, the story of the couple associated with the mansion is forgotten, but it is now operated as a guest house by a mysterious 'caretaker' who appears one day. He begins inviting people who must love, following the spirits of the couple, to the mansion...! 'Welcome to the secretive mansion Yeongchunhwa, which will bring endless imagination to you. Here, any form of love is possible. Love and indulge to your heart’s content, as long as the mansion permits.' A luxurious mansion and people visiting for various reasons. Erotic stories for women, drawn by various artists, are now unfolding.\n\n[Original Webtoon (R15)](https://page.kakao.com/content/63612163)",
